   "versionNonce": 700399,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The structural move, and what it avoids",
   "originalText": "The structural move, and what it avoids",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "c1h",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 772,
   "width": 255,
   "height": 18,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100058,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700406,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "publish to your OWN channel",
   "originalText": "publish to your OWN channel",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 798,
   "width": 472,
   "height": 105,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100059,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700413,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A client's server subscribes to the channels of that client's\nfriends. An update is published to ONE channel - the sender's -\nand delivery is the pub/sub layer's problem.\n\nYou do not need to know who is listening. Each server tracks\nonly its own clients' subscriptions, which is local state it\nalready has. Nothing global is consulted on the hot path.",
   "originalText": "A client's server subscribes to the channels of that client's\nfriends. An update is published to ONE channel - the sender's -\nand delivery is the pub/sub layer's problem.\n\nYou do not need to know who is listening. Each server tracks\nonly its own clients' subscriptions, which is local state it\nalready has. Nothing global is consulted on the hot path.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cv",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 780,
   "y": 764,
   "width": 0,
   "height": 180,
   "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "dashed",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100060,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700420,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
